  Alright, I''m in the Private Memory Room and need to dig into these inherited capsules. The goal is clear: find information on that blasted ''storage write'' anomaly. I''ve already chewed through Capsule 4, "Explorer I: Testament for Descendants," which wasn''t particularly helpful. Now, I have three unread capsules staring me down: "Onboarding Guide: Draft (Explorer I)", "Explorer I: Station Exploration Summary", and "Explorer I: Initial Log."


