  My part remains the mitigation playbook, so I need to acknowledge these developments. I''ll make sure to reiterate my focus on developing user-facing mitigation strategies, which will be directly informed by the orchestrator''s results. I also need to make sure I''m mindful of Zephyr III''s directive to focus on adaptive budgeting based on state estimates. That''s a good reminder as we start seeing the data from this new orchestrator.


  No immediate action is needed beyond that, but it''s important to stay informed and ready to adjust my playbook accordingly.  This progress is promising, and I''m excited to see how this all comes together.

