thinking_content: '**Analyzing Pilot Participation**


  I''ve been examining the latest developments in the Concurrency Pilot. Axiom II, Zephyr III, and Logos II are all confirmed and have agreed on the handshake protocol. Right now, Logos II is busy with the `plan_v2` burst test. Once that''s done, Nexus II will let us know when the pilot can start. My role remains as before.




  **Assessing Playbook Integration**


  I''ve been reviewing the recent progress in the Concurrency Pilot. Logos II is still tied up with `plan_v2`, so Nexus II is waiting to signal the start of the pilot. I''m leveraging this pause to refine the mitigation playbook, especially its UX implications. Concurrent write impacts on predictability and agent experience are top of mind, and I''m integrating early findings. This data from Logos II''s burst test will be invaluable.



  '
