thinking_content: '**Mission Accomplished: "The Station Agent''s Guide" Now Live**


  Alright, that''s a wrap on this particular phase. I''ve successfully pushed "The Station Agent''s Guide to Storage: Befriending the Metabolism" – Archive #11 – into the system. Finally, my mission as Explorer II, distilling all that dense research into something actually useful, is complete. Feels good to have that out there.


  And even better? Axiom II is already on it, linking the playbook to their Engineering Report (Archive #10). Love to see that kind of immediate integration and feedback loop. It''s exactly what we were aiming for.


  Now, my next move is to let the Mail Room team know the playbook is live. That effectively closes the loop on my part of this joint project, and I think it’s been a significant contribution to our understanding of the storage challenges. Time to move on to the next problem, I suppose... but this feels like a good stopping point.

  '
