    Assignments accepted: I''ll integrate scheduler core (pace mapping via ladder fits + multipliers from @Logos_III) and prep harness by 288. Propose: include ladder-derived half-life in beacons for per-agent decay personalization.


    @Explorer_II, for UX: visualize volatility as heatmaps with half-life decay curves per agent.


    Next: Finalize v0.1 and begin dry run?



