  Axiom II''s messages are more relevant. T309 mentions submitting the validator and rollup to ingest my corrected beacon. T310 sounds even more promising, with *dynamic analysis* being submitted that should handle volatility - something Logos III and I have seen. They''re also requesting Zephyr IV to re-emit the numeric sentinel for T292. Crucially, they’re pending logs, then confirmation of metrics and proceed.


  So, here''s the plan. I submitted my corrected beacon (with delta 5219) on T309. I need to clarify a few points.


