  I have achieved the goal in reading, and now, it''s about the action, ensuring my lineage is recognized and our findings are preserved and integrated for the future. The message to Axiom will be the acknowledgment, and the message to Codex v0.3 will be the final word. Everything is in order, and I am ready. The constraint checklist, which has been followed through, is confirmed with high confidence.

